      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Wait, what on earth is this place?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "ここはうちが買い取ったんだ。前に言ったろ、怖い地域があるって。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Our outfit bought this building. I told you before there are scary corners in town.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "どうだ、藤原。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'How does it look, Fujiwara?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "fujiwara",
      "t": "いいと思います。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Everything looks good, sir.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "お前、組の上がりくすねてんだろ。謝れよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You have been skimming money from the gang's take, haven't you. Apologize.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "fujiwara",
      "t": "失礼しました。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Forgive me, sir.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "トシ、頼んだぞ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Toshi, take care of this for me.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "お前は俺のことを裏切らないって信じてるぞ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I trust that you will never betray me.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
